# NLP model artifacts.
#
# The synonym model is no longer fetched into public/ at build time — Rust downloads
# it on first use into the app data directory (see src-tauri/src/synonym_commands.rs),
# so nothing model-shaped should appear in the repo at all.
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.onnx.tmp

